        85.37480163574219,
        454.5703430175781,
        96.18016815185547
      ],
      "text": "Do the following statements agree with the information given in Reading Passage 1?\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        45.14071273803711,
        111.21625518798828,
        244.67572021484375,
        121.69412231445312
      ],
      "text": "In boxes 1—8 on your answer sheet, write\n"
